### Session 10 · Build 5 · SupportApi        dotnet run  → http://localhost:5080
@api = http://localhost:5080

### What can the agent use?
GET {{api}}/

### A ticket with an order number (one step)
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "Where is my refund for order 4411? It's been ages." }

### A ticket with only an email (two steps: FindOrders → GetOrder)
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "I cancelled my plan last week and still no refund!! priya@example.com" }

### EDIT 3 · a conversation: first message
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "Where is my refund for order 4411?", "conversationId": "T-1001" }

### EDIT 3 · same conversation, a follow-up that only makes sense with memory
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "Thanks. Which order was that again?", "conversationId": "T-1001" }

### A different conversation: blank memory
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "Which order was that again?", "conversationId": "T-2002" }
